# Machine-local chezmoi source entries: still applied by `chezmoi apply` on
# this machine, but deliberately not committed, so they never sync to another
# machine and never land in the repo's history.

# Atomic Ceph S3 profile (~/.aws/config). Holds no key -- the key is fetched at
# runtime by ~/.local/bin/atmc-s3-credentials -- but the endpoint and profile
# are work-infrastructure detail that stays off GitHub.
